	(text "J42: 2x13 IDC, every data line has an adjacent GND (odd pins = signals, even pins = GND except pin22=CLK_EN, pin26=CLK_FB).\nDoubles as the Pico 2 v0 ribbon attachment. CONTENTION RULE: Cmod in J40 OR ribbon on J42, never both.\nSignals + GND only: both platforms are self-powered; the mic rail 3V3_MIC stays on the array sheet (T-010/T-012)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262 218 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "28ddc76a-4368-491a-8f6a-40c860acd1dc")
	)
	(text "DNP ETHERNET PROVISION (D012 amendment b): U60 LAN8720A + J43 HR911105A MagJack + X1 50 MHz osc + R400-R403/C400-C406 are ALL DNP on v1.\n100M RMII carries only the decimated stream (raw PDM needs the FT232H). Populate-and-learn milestone, never a respin.\nMODE[2:0]/PHYAD0 strap levels (RXD0/RXD1/CRS_DV/RXER pins) are sampled at nRST release - Artix-7 config-time weak pull-ups can\noverride the PHY's internal strap pulls; determine strap resistors from the LAN8720A datasheet at populate time.\nTCT to +3.3V / RCT decoupled per LAN8720A voltage-mode reference - verify against the chosen PHY+jack datasheets at populate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 285 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fa4a779e-173e-489f-b0fe-446d846e16af")
	)
